{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026frnmrrNBDu1793286051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國上月通脹表現略為升溫，但符合市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國聯儲局用作衡量通脹指標的個人消費開支物價指數PCE，9月按年升百分之3.6，按月升百分之0.5，兩個數據都較8月高0.2個百分點，並與市場預期相同。</p><p></p><p>扣除食品和能源的核心個人消費開支物價指數PCE，97月按年升百分之3.1，按月升百分之0.3，兩個數據都符合市場預期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.353072+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:14.023659+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:29.795650+00:00","content_hash":"1e76fd88d101f47e0f67b237167a76d2193e77cf7b7769bf6d97c0e0f10664e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.353072+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}